('127.394.d.11.F',4,'A digital device that cannot interact with the physical world is of limited use because it cannot:','["have a program", "sense inputs or control outputs", "store numbers", "use binary"]'::jsonb,1,'Interaction makes devices useful.','original'),
('127.394.d.11.G',3,'Digital control devices such as microcontrollers are valuable because they are:','["unchangeable", "always analog", "programmable and flexible", "unable to adapt"]'::jsonb,2,'Software defines behavior.','original'),
('127.394.d.11.G',4,'Compared with hard-wired logic, changing a microcontroller''s behavior usually requires only:','["a bigger case", "new batteries", "rewiring the board", "changing the program"]'::jsonb,3,'Reprogramming is easy.','original'),
('127.394.d.11.H',3,'Solving a real problem with a microcontroller involves both hardware and:','["software", "plumbing", "furniture", "paperwork"]'::jsonb,0,'Both are needed.','original'),
