('127.395.d.1.G',4,'A community college certificate in automation prepares students for jobs as:','["judges", "surgeons", "pilots", "technicians"]'::jsonb,3,'Certificates prepare technicians.','original'),
('127.395.d.1.H',3,'Competing in a robotics competition such as FIRST or VEX helps students build:','["teamwork and technical skills", "only free time", "no skills", "only trophies"]'::jsonb,0,'Competitions teach real skills.','original'),
('127.395.d.1.H',4,'A job shadow at a plant with robotic cells lets a student:','["take home equipment", "see how robots are used on the job", "operate robots unsupervised", "skip safety training"]'::jsonb,1,'Shadowing is observation.','original'),
('127.395.d.1.I',3,'ABET accredits college programs in applied science, computing, engineering, and engineering:','["trade", "tourism", "technology", "tutoring"]'::jsonb,2,'The T in ABET.','original'),
('127.395.d.1.I',4,'Choosing an ABET-accredited robotics program gives students confidence that the program:','["is easy", "is free", "has no exams", "meets professional standards"]'::jsonb,3,'Accreditation reviews quality.','original'),
('127.395.d.2.A',3,'On a robot build, the mechanical, electrical, and programming subteams must:','["coordinate their designs", "work in secret", "avoid each other", "compete"]'::jsonb,0,'Subsystems must fit together.','original'),
('127.395.d.2.A',4,'A robotics team that shares a common goal is more likely to:','["avoid testing", "finish the robot on time", "miss competitions", "lose parts"]'::jsonb,1,'Shared goals align effort.','original'),
('127.395.d.2.B',3,'When a robot arm fails to reach a target, the team should first:','["give up", "replace the motor", "observe and describe the failure", "blame the coder"]'::jsonb,2,'Understand before fixing.','original'),
