('127.395.d.3.B',4,'A task that must finish on time or the whole schedule slips is on the:','["spare list", "critical path", "wish list", "side street"]'::jsonb,1,'Critical tasks have no slack.','original'),
('127.395.d.3.C',3,'In a simulated robotics company, a design engineer is responsible for:','["cooking lunch", "selling tickets", "creating the robot design", "cleaning windows"]'::jsonb,2,'Engineers design.','original'),
('127.395.d.3.C',4,'A team creating a robot kit to sell might survey potential customers to learn their:','["pets", "hobbies", "birthdays", "needs"]'::jsonb,3,'Market research finds needs.','original'),
('127.395.d.3.D',3,'A production plan for a single robot should list the parts, tools, and:','["assembly steps", "birthdays", "lunch breaks", "parking spots"]'::jsonb,0,'Plans cover how to build.','original'),
