('127.395.d.4.D',3,'Lithium polymer battery packs used in robots can be hazardous because they may:','["overheat or catch fire if damaged", "taste sweet", "turn to water", "emit cold"]'::jsonb,0,'Damaged LiPo cells can ignite.','original'),
