('127.395.d.10.D',4,'If a robot passes only 7 of 10 test trials but the requirement is 9 of 10, it:','["exceeds it", "needs no changes", "passes", "does not yet meet the requirement"]'::jsonb,3,'7 is below 9.','original'),
('127.395.d.10.E',3,'After tests reveal weak welds, refining the design may include:','["strengthening the joints", "ignoring data", "painting only", "removing the design"]'::jsonb,0,'Fix what testing exposed.','original'),
('127.395.d.10.E',4,'Refining a design for quality and safety may include adding:','["sharp edges", "guards and sensors", "more clutter", "extra gaps"]'::jsonb,1,'Safety features improve designs.','original'),
