('127.396.d.1.D',4,'Describing a robot''s path using coordinates on a grid is an example of using:','["guessing", "no units", "slang", "multiple representations"]'::jsonb,3,'Coordinates and diagrams are representations.','original'),
('127.396.d.1.E',3,'A flowchart of a robot''s decisions is a representation that organizes its:','["logic", "wiring colors", "shipping", "paint"]'::jsonb,0,'Flowcharts show decision logic.','original'),
